    "title": "Belgrade school meal debt tops $110K - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By SEAN BATURA Belgrade News ,\n11 hours ago Meal debt at Belgrade Public Schools was over $110,000 as of April 8, according to a spokesperson for the school district. In its attempts to collect the monies owed, the district uses several approaches. Initially, when a student is in arrears in their meal account, his or her family receives an automated notice from Infinite Campus informing them of their balance, according to district spokeswoman Brenda Throop. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
